    "scope": "The dam spans the water boundary between PMTiles reservoir 12728533 and downstream river 64482123, with the crest road 35184859541115 and native powerhouse 35185554367336. The signed frame is [92.294444, 55.934722], heading 2.53505751713827 radians. Local +X follows the crest northwest and +Z faces downstream. The crossing separation and exact native power hall and rail bridge replacement passed the focused production checks. The downstream public road bridge remains present.",
    "notes": "The gate division, caisson, machinery and rail elevations are visual estimates. The source terrain still has local bank artifacts and coarse grade transitions. Physical-device timings remain unmeasured."
